==Icelandic==
{{wikipedia|lang=is}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|friðr||peace|lang=is}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfrɪːðʏr/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ɪːðʏr|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|m|friðar|-}}

# [[peace]]
#* [[Universal Declaration of Human Rights]] ([http://www.ohchr.org/EN/UDHR/Pages/Language.aspx?LangID=ice Icelandic], [http://www.ohchr.org/EN/UDHR/Pages/Language.aspx?LangID=eng English])
#*: ''Það ber að viðurkenna, að hver maður sé jafnborinn til virðingar og réttinda, er eigi verði af honum tekin, og er þetta undirstaða frelsis, réttlætis og '''friðar''' i heiminum.''
#*:: Whereas recognition of the inherent dignity and of the equal and inalienable rights of all members of the human family is the foundation of freedom, justice and '''peace''' in the world.
# [[tranquility]]

